    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## M05 - Exchange-rate watcher\nProvider = mock-api `/rates/latest` (USD base, rates drift a little on every call). Fetch via **P02** (backoff), compare each quote with its last `rate_history` row, store the new rates, alert when a pair moved >= `threshold_pct` (Config).\n\nPer-pair **cooldown** in Redis (6 h) keeps a volatile pair from spamming. First run: no previous -> no alert.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "a31c2e1f-7e57-53b5-806d-2bfe9fd2d4de",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
